&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;└─# ffuf -w /usr/share/seclists/Discovery/Web-Content/directory-list-2.3-big.txt -u http://billing.thm/mbilling/FUZZ -fs &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;30760&lt;/span&gt;
